REQUIRES: system-windows
XFAIL: *

cmd.exe parses its own command line, so it must receive the command line
its caller wrote, not one rebuilt from split arguments.
Known failures: #140 (command lines are rebuilt on Windows).

RUN: %e2e probe cmd-quoting | FileCheck %s
RUN: %catter script::cdb -q -o %t.json -- %e2e probe cmd-quoting | FileCheck %s

CHECK: PASS cmd-quoting
